@startuml
title traffic-light
note as machineNote
    A pedestrian button shortens the green phase.
end note
legend
    cycles = 0
    requested = false
endlegend
[*] --> red
state red
red : exit / cycles = cycles + 1
state green
note right of green : Cut short when a pedestrian is waiting.
state amber
amber : entry / requested = false
red --> green: after(30s)
green --> amber: after(25s)
green : button\n[ !requested ]\n/ requested = true
green --> amber: button\n[ requested ]
amber --> red: after(3s)
@enduml
